      "content": "\"let the exhaustion take over\"... what does that even mean? it feels like there’s just no way out of this shame. i was supposed to be their success story. now i'm just this broken thing they have to deal with. it feels like the only way to stop the feeling of being a letdown is to just... not be here anymore. does that sound crazy?",
